  "contract": [
    "Registration belongs to the actual Application object; null/duplicates are retained and unregister removes the first match using real virtual callback.equals.",
    "Each real Activity super body dispatches an ordered snapshot, so reentrant register/unregister affects later events and does not remove an in-flight callback.",
    "All seven callbacks receive the actual Activity. Created uses its actual nullable input Bundle; saved application state uses one real Bundle shared with Activity and callbacks.",
    "API 26 mCalled timing is preserved: Start/Destroy/Restart mark before dispatch; Create/Resume/Pause/Stop mark after successful dispatch. Saved state does not require super; Pause requires it for targetSdk >= 9.",
    "Callbacks and in-flight Application/Activity/Bundle payloads are GC traced. Side tables have weak Application keys and do not retain a dead detached Application.",
    "Missing/null callback bodies, invalid registration types, callback exceptions, and missing required super calls propagate actual typed failures; no silent successful delivery.",
    "Object.equals inherits identity only when no DEX class override exists. Explicit resolved Object super/nonvirtual calls retain identity without redispatch. String.endsWith reads actual content and throws NullPointerException for null suffix.",
    "Exact newly implemented Object.equals and String.endsWith instance descriptors are in the shared JNI method catalog.",
    "Main launch/draw/input/tick/stop boundaries integrate scoped uncaught reporting; caught DEX exceptions remain catchable and already-dispatched worker exceptions are not reported twice."
  ],
